    {
      "index": 1,
      "shot": 1,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "text": "一个AI Agent，自己拆任务、找素材、剪视频，全程没人插手。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "text": "多Agent协作听起来很酷，但实际用起来一塌糊涂。",
      "start": 5.55,
      "end": 9.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "text": "主Agent串行调度子Agent，谁先谁后全靠它判断。",
      "start": 9.88,
      "end": 14.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "text": "任务一复杂，主Agent自己就成瓶颈了，子Agent崩了整个流程就卡死。",
      "start": 14.56,
      "end": 20.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "text": "Hermes的思路完全不一样：把任务扔上看板，让Agent自己去抢。",
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 26.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "text": "底层SQLite加原子事务，",
      "start": 26.7,
      "end": 29.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "text": "多个Agent同时抢同一个任务，",
      "start": 29.12,
      "end": 31.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "text": "只有一个能拿到，",
      "start": 31.9,
      "end": 33.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 5,
      "text": "不会重复执行。",
      "start": 33.28,
      "end": 34.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "text": "更厉害的是依赖引擎。",
      "start": 34.5,
      "end": 36.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "text": "上游任务完成，下游自动从待办提到就绪。",
      "start": 36.23,
      "end": 39.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "text": "Worker之间交接走结构化的summary和metadata，不用翻聊天记录。",
      "start": 39.52,
      "end": 46.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "text": "Agent挂了？",
